sequenceDiagram
  participant source as Permitted scholarship source
  participant worker as Ingestion worker
  participant db as PostgreSQL
  actor moderator as Authorized moderator
  participant api as Django API
  participant visitor as Public catalog client
  worker->>db: Check source permission and ingestion flag
  worker->>source: Retrieve permitted untrusted facts
  source-->>worker: Facts and provenance
  worker->>db: Save candidate and evidence, never publish
  moderator->>api: Review candidate through scoped admin interface
  api->>db: Authorize moderator and return candidate version
  api-->>moderator: Evidence and version ETag
  moderator->>api: Publish with CSRF, If-Match, evidence and idempotency key
  api->>db: Lock candidate, check current source permission and complete facts
  alt Stale version or source permission missing
    api-->>moderator: 412 or safe denial, no publication
  else Reviewed permitted valid facts
    api->>db: Atomic immutable published version, audit and outbox
    db-->>api: Commit
    api-->>moderator: Published version
    worker->>db: Deliver deduplicated publication outbox event
    visitor->>api: Public scholarship search
    api->>db: Read published projection only
    api-->>visitor: Approved facts and verification state
  end
